file lotus/stereo_bell.rye the module — the same two cutoffs and one gain on both channels, turn the middle hold the edges
file tools/ales_stereo_bell_witness.rish the witness proving it GREEN on metal
recommend keep-going the stereo EQ class holds tone, shelf, band-pass, notch, and bell — the fixed-EQ family whole; the next Lindy rungs carry the remaining mono filters (the carried filter ALES43, the deesser) or open the stereo modulation class
